\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 45 min</span><span>Intermediate</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Conditional Formatting সহজ ভাষায় explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain Conditional Formatting in plain language.\">Explain Conditional Formatting in plain language.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Realistic analytical task-এ Conditional Formatting ব্যবহার করুন।\" data-en=\"Use Conditional Formatting in a realistic analytical task.\">Use Conditional Formatting in a realistic analytical task.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Result-কে প্রভাবিত করা quality check ও limitation চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Identify the quality checks and limitations that affect the result.\">Identify the quality checks and limitations that affect the result.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Example, activity ও chapter exercise complete করুন।\" data-en=\"Complete the example, activity, and chapter exercises.\">Complete the example, activity, and chapter exercises.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Conditional Formatting কী?\" data-en=\"What is Conditional Formatting?\">What is Conditional Formatting?</h2><p data-bn=\"Rule, threshold, formula, data bar ও color scale ব্যবহার করে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ pattern ও exception highlight করতে শিখবেন। Chapter-এ প্রয়োজনীয় definition, syntax, formula বা interface ধাপে ধাপে ব্যাখ্যা করা হয়েছে।\" data-en=\"Conditional formatting changes cell appearance based on values or formulas. Rules include highlights, top or bottom values, data bars, color scales, icon sets, and custom formulas.\">Conditional formatting changes cell appearance based on values or formulas. Rules include highlights, top or bottom values, data bars, color scales, icon sets, and custom formulas.</p><div class=\"formula-block\"><span>Excel</span><code>=AND($D2=\"Open\",$E2&lt;TODAY())</code><button aria-label=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy-code\" data-copy-code=\"\" type=\"button\">Copy</button></div><div class=\"inline-example\"><strong data-bn=\"উদাহরণ\" data-en=\"Example\">Example</strong><p data-bn='=AND($D2=\"Open\",$E2&lt;TODAY())' data-en='=AND($D2=\"Open\",$E2&lt;TODAY())'>=AND($D2=\"Open\",$E2&lt;TODAY())</p></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Data analyst যেভাবে ব্যবহার করেন\" data-en=\"How data analysts use it\">How data analysts use it</h2><p data-bn=\"Data analystরা sales, finance, HR, operations ও project dataset-এ Conditional Formatting ব্যবহার করে data clean, calculate, summarize, compare বা validate করেন। Worked example-এ input, process, output ও verification দেখুন।\" data-en=\"Analysts use it to flag overdue cases, budget variance, duplicates, missing fields, thresholds, and trends in compact tables.\">Analysts use it to flag overdue cases, budget variance, duplicates, missing fields, thresholds, and trends in compact tables.</p><div class=\"inline-example\"><strong data-bn=\"উদাহরণ\" data-en=\"Example\">Example</strong><p data-bn=\"Worked example-এ বাস্তব analytical dataset ব্যবহার করে এই concept-এর input, process এবং expected output দেখানো হয়েছে।\" data-en=\"A task table has Status and Due_Date.\">A task table has Status and Due_Date.</p></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Rule, check ও good practice\" data-en=\"Rules, checks, and good practice\">Rules, checks, and good practice</h2><p data-bn=\"সঠিক ফলের জন্য source data, cell বা range, data type, criteria এবং business definition যাচাই করুন। Result-কে independent total বা control check দিয়ে reconcile করুন এবং assumption document করুন।\" data-en=\"Choose accessible colors, state the rule, manage rule order and Stop If True behavior, use formula anchoring correctly, and never rely on color as the only communication channel.\">Choose accessible colors, state the rule, manage rule order and Stop If True behavior, use formula anchoring correctly, and never rely on color as the only communication channel.</p><div class=\"inline-example\"><strong data-bn=\"উদাহরণ\" data-en=\"Example\">Example</strong><p data-bn=\"Worked example-এ বাস্তব analytical dataset ব্যবহার করে এই concept-এর input, process এবং expected output দেখানো হয়েছে।\" data-en=\"Before sharing the workbook, confirm the result against an independent check and document any assumption.\">Before sharing the workbook, confirm the result against an independent check and document any assumption.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Conditional format\" data-en=\"Conditional format\">Conditional format</h3><p data-bn=\"Conditional format হলো Conditional Formatting chapter-এ ব্যবহৃত একটি গুরুত্বপূর্ণ term। এটি formula, feature বা analytical workflow-এর নির্দিষ্ট অংশ বোঝায়; chapter-এর example-এ এর ব্যবহার দেখুন।\" data-en=\"A style applied when a rule is true.\">A style applied when a rule is true.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Formula rule\" data-en=\"Formula rule\">Formula rule</h3><p data-bn=\"Formula rule হলো Conditional Formatting chapter-এ ব্যবহৃত একটি গুরুত্বপূর্ণ term। এটি formula, feature বা analytical workflow-এর নির্দিষ্ট অংশ বোঝায়; chapter-এর example-এ এর ব্যবহার দেখুন।\" data-en=\"A conditional-format rule driven by a formula.\">A conditional-format rule driven by a formula.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Color scale\" data-en=\"Color scale\">Color scale</h3><p data-bn=\"Color scale হলো Conditional Formatting chapter-এ ব্যবহৃত একটি গুরুত্বপূর্ণ term। এটি formula, feature বা analytical workflow-এর নির্দিষ্ট অংশ বোঝায়; chapter-এর example-এ এর ব্যবহার দেখুন।\" data-en=\"A gradient mapping values to colors.\">A gradient mapping values to colors.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Rule precedence\" data-en=\"Rule precedence\">Rule precedence</h3><p data-bn=\"Rule precedence হলো Conditional Formatting chapter-এ ব্যবহৃত একটি গুরুত্বপূর্ণ term। এটি formula, feature বা analytical workflow-এর নির্দিষ্ট অংশ বোঝায়; chapter-এর example-এ এর ব্যবহার দেখুন।\" data-en=\"The order in which overlapping rules are evaluated.\">The order in which overlapping rules are evaluated.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Worked example: Conditional Formatting\" data-en=\"Highlight overdue open tasks\">Highlight overdue open tasks</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একটি বাস্তব dataset-এ Conditional Formatting প্রয়োগ করে analytical question-এর উত্তর তৈরি করা হবে। শুরু করার আগে input ও business rule যাচাই করুন।\" data-en=\"A task table has Status and Due_Date.\">A task table has Status and Due_Date.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"প্রয়োজনীয় business question, input range এবং expected output নির্ধারণ করুন।\" data-en=\"Select the full row range.\">Select the full row range.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Chapter-এর formula, command বা feature ব্যবহার করে calculation বা transformation সম্পন্ন করুন।\" data-en=\"Create a formula rule with fixed columns and relative row.\">Create a formula rule with fixed columns and relative row.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Manual filter, source total বা alternative method দিয়ে result যাচাই করুন।\" data-en=\"Choose a high-contrast but accessible format.\">Choose a high-contrast but accessible format.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Blank, duplicate, invalid value, error এবং edge case পরীক্ষা করুন।\" data-en=\"Test open, closed, overdue, and future cases.\">Test open, closed, overdue, and future cases.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Final result, interpretation, assumption ও limitation document করুন।\" data-en=\"Add a text status field for accessibility.\">Add a text status field for accessibility.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Conditional Formatting থেকে পাওয়া result business definition, source data, validation এবং context-এর সঙ্গে মিলিয়ে ব্যাখ্যা করতে হবে।\" data-en=\"A good rule communicates an analytical condition, not merely visual decoration.\">A good rule communicates an analytical condition, not merely visual decoration.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/excel-data-analytics/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Rule, threshold, formula, data bar ও color scale ব্যবহার করে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ pattern ও exception highlight করতে শিখবেন।\" data-en=\"Conditional formatting changes cell appearance based on values or formulas.\">Conditional formatting changes cell appearance based on values or formulas.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Data analystরা sales, finance, HR, operations ও project dataset-এ Conditional Formatting ব্যবহার করে data clean, calculate, summarize, compare বা validate করেন। Worked example-এ input, process, output ও verification দেখুন।\" data-en=\"Analysts use it to flag overdue cases, budget variance, duplicates, missing fields, thresholds, and trends in compact tables.\">Analysts use it to flag overdue cases, budget variance, duplicates, missing fields, thresholds, and trends in compact tables.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"সঠিক ফলের জন্য source data, cell বা range, data type, criteria এবং business definition যাচাই করুন। Result-কে independent total বা control check দিয়ে reconcile করুন এবং assumption document করুন।\" data-en=\"Choose accessible colors, state the rule, manage rule order and Stop If True behavior, use formula anchoring correctly, and never rely on color as the only communication channel.\">Choose accessible colors, state the rule, manage rule order and Stop If True behavior, use formula anchoring correctly, and never rely on color as the only communication channel.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Conditional Formatting থেকে পাওয়া result business definition, source data, validation এবং context-এর সঙ্গে মিলিয়ে ব্যাখ্যা করতে হবে।\" data-en=\"A good rule communicates an analytical condition, not merely visual decoration.\">A good rule communicates an analytical condition, not merely visual decoration.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/excel/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Excel Help &amp; Learning ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/excel/use-conditional-formatting-to-highlight-information-in-excel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft official topic reference ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/let-and-readable-formulas/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"LET ও Readable Formula Design\" data-en=\"LET and Readable Formula Design\">LET and Readable Formula Design</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/excel-data-analytics/descriptive-statistics-in-excel/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Excel-এ Descriptive Statistics\" data-en=\"Descriptive Statistics in Excel\">Descriptive Statistics in Excel</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}